WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:01.700
It's filing week.

00:01.860 --> 00:03.500
And your inbox just blew up.

00:04.950 --> 00:06.500
Meet InboxCA.

00:08.040 --> 00:10.300
Reads every client email.

00:11.180 --> 00:13.800
Files every paper in the right folder.

00:14.450 --> 00:16.700
Replies to clients on its own.

00:17.720 --> 00:20.300
Reminds clients only for what's missing.

00:20.990 --> 00:23.300
Keeps forms ready for your approval.

00:24.050 --> 00:25.600
Nothing pending.

00:27.500 --> 00:30.700
InboxCA. Less chasing. More doing.
